WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.506
Restoring a backup replaces the records on
this device.

00:00:04.656 --> 00:00:07.168
Save a backup of what you have now before
you start.

00:00:08.468 --> 00:00:11.700
In Settings, open Data Management, then
Restore Backup.

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.163
Choose the backup file in Files.

00:00:15.063 --> 00:00:18.721
You'll need the key used to save it if this
device doesn't already have that key.

00:00:19.971 --> 00:00:21.897
Read the restore summary before confirming.

00:00:22.997 --> 00:00:27.386
Check that you've chosen the right file,
because this isn't a way to merge two sets
of records.

00:00:28.686 --> 00:00:32.588
Confirm the restore when you're ready, then
check Today and your saved records.

00:00:33.588 --> 00:00:37.837
Device-only settings, including the privacy
lock, need checking separately afterwards.
